<title>HONG KONG: Quake detected off Kuril Islands off Japan - HK.</title>
<headline>Quake detected off Kuril Islands off Japan - HK.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>A strong earthquake estimated at 6.1 on the Richter scale was recorded off Japan, the Hong Kong Royal Obervatory said on Saturday.</p>
<p>The epicentre of the quake, detected at 7.47 a.m. on Saturday local time (2347 GMT Friday), was off the east coast of the Kuril Islands, about 1210 km (750 miles) northeast of Tokyo, Japan, the observatory said.</p>
<p>It gave no further details.</p>
